OL,3,GNEWSAHunt for rapists convicted of
OL,4,Ateenager's abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men found guilty of raping a
OL,7,Fteenage girl who was groomed,
OL,8,Ftrafficked and exploited in Rotherham
OL,9,F20 years ago are on the run, the
OL,10,FNational Crime Agency (NCA) has said.
OL,12,FOn Thursday, Mudasar Hussain, 37, his
OL,13,Fbrother Ghazanfar Hussain, 42, and
OL,14,FKamir Khan, 37, were all found guilty
OL,15,Fof raping the girl following a trial at
OL,16,FSheffield Crown Court.
OL,18,FOnly Ghazanfar Hussain was present,
OL,19,Fhowever, with the whereabouts of the
OL,20,Fother two men unknown.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
